<title>GERMANY: Freight forwarding body FIATA names new director.</title>
<headline>Freight forwarding body FIATA names new director.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The International Federation of Freight Forwarders Associations (FIATA) said it has appointed Marco Sangaletti as its new director designate.</p>
<p>He will work from March alongside current director Helmut Joehri, who will retire in the autumn, a statement said.</p>
<p>Sangaletti has worked for freight forwarding companies and as shipping and logistics manager for a large department store company, FIATA said.</p>
<p>-Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 fax+44 171 542  5017</p>
